3,"Kaxararí Language (KTX) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map, Endangered Level & Official Use | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/ktx/,Kaxararí is an endangered indigenous language of Brazil. It belongs to the Panoan language family. The language is used as a first language by some people in every generation of the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,Kaxararí,Panoan
